# Drop your Live2D model files here.
#
# Required:
#   *.model3.json   (the manifest — main entry point)
#   *.moc3          (the mesh)
#   *.png           (textures, possibly multiple)
#
# Optional but recommended:
#   *.physics3.json  (hair/cloth physics)
#   *.motion3.json   (idle / tap motions)
#   *.exp3.json      (expressions)
#   *.cdi3.json      (parameter display info)
#   *.pose3.json     (pose presets)
#
# The loader (web/avatar.js) looks for:
#   web/assets/Luna.model3.json
#   web/assets/luna.model3.json
#   web/assets/model.model3.json
#   web/assets/index.json   (an explicit manifest URL)
# in that order. Rename your model's .model3.json to one of these
# (Luna.model3.json is preferred), or create index.json with:
#   { "url": "your-model.model3.json" }
#
# All model binaries (*.moc3, *.model3.json, *.png, *.physics3.json, etc.)
# are .gitignored — they will NOT be committed. Only this .gitkeep is tracked
# so the folder always exists in a fresh clone.